[block
  'ORD-0001-virtual-paths'
  [ctx
    'the spec of EMS-002'
    '.guidelines/.orders/EMS-002/EMS-002.pgml'
  [/ctx]
  [tgt
    'glyph-vpath: the virtual paths of .plan section 0, layers 1, 4, 5 and 6, keyed by the slug'
  [/tgt]
  [cnst
    'JSON and XML enter the index to depth 2, the root at depth 0; a deeper selector resolves by reading the file, under the fingerprint the index holds for it'
  [/cnst]
  [cnst
    'the line range is the first line and the count, as a windowed read takes them'
  [/cnst]
  [cnst
    'the RETURN.md of a series is a log, and stays out of sources, as CHANGELOG.md does'
  [/cnst]
  [cmp
    'the trees'
    'the extension decides the selector: .md by heading slug, .json by JSON Pointer, .xml by element path, code and text by @block and @endblock; an empty selector is the whole file; zero nodes or many is an error, never an empty slice'
    [ctx[/ctx]
    [cnst[/cnst]
  [/cmp]
  [sub
    [eq
      [cmp
        [ctx[/ctx]
      [/cmp]
    [/eq]
  [/sub]
  [elab
    [eq[/eq]
    [sub[/sub]
    [rsn[/rsn]
  [/elab]
  [ref
    [cnst[/cnst]
  [/ref]
  [ctx[/ctx]
  [core[/core]
  [core[/core]
  [elab[/elab]
  [cmp
    'the index'
    'every file of .guidelines, the attic and the index aside, with README.md and CLAUDE.md, in the index; each node with its byte range, its line range and its fingerprint, and every entry resolves to content that is not empty'
    [ctx[/ctx]
    [cnst[/cnst]
  [/cmp]
  [sub
    [eq
      [cmp
        [ctx[/ctx]
      [/cmp]
    [/eq]
  [/sub]
  [elab
    [eq[/eq]
    [sub[/sub]
    [rsn[/rsn]
  [/elab]
  [ref
    [cnst[/cnst]
  [/ref]
  [ctx[/ctx]
  [core[/core]
  [core[/core]
  [elab[/elab]
  [cmp
    'the resolver'
    'many paths read each file once, the answer carries the offsets, the slice arrives under its own virtual path, and a fingerprint that no longer matches is refused'
    [ctx[/ctx]
    [cnst[/cnst]
  [/cmp]
  [sub
    [eq
      [cmp
        [ctx[/ctx]
      [/cmp]
    [/eq]
  [/sub]
  [elab
    [eq[/eq]
    [sub[/sub]
    [rsn[/rsn]
  [/elab]
  [ref
    [cnst[/cnst]
  [/ref]
  [ctx[/ctx]
  [core[/core]
  [core[/core]
  [elab[/elab]
  [cmp
    'sources'
    'a document declares its sources in its frontmatter, the index answers which documents a file feeds by inversion, and the seeds of INTAKE-VIRTUAL-PATH section 19 enter'
    [ctx[/ctx]
    [cnst[/cnst]
  [/cmp]
  [sub
    [eq
      [cmp
        [ctx[/ctx]
      [/cmp]
    [/eq]
  [/sub]
  [elab
    [eq[/eq]
    [sub[/sub]
    [rsn[/rsn]
  [/elab]
  [ref
    [cnst[/cnst]
  [/ref]
  [ctx[/ctx]
  [core[/core]
  [core[/core]
  [elab[/elab]
  [cmp
    'the gate'
    'npm run check refuses an index that drifted, a file left out, a source that does not resolve and a stale source, each seen failing before it counts'
    [ctx[/ctx]
    [cnst[/cnst]
  [/cmp]
  [sub
    [eq
      [cmp
        [ctx[/ctx]
      [/cmp]
    [/eq]
  [/sub]
